; PATTERNS.GRX: loops and variables
; usage: GRAPHER PATTERNS
HIRES
; a fan
FOR X 0 239 6
  LINE X 0 239-X 199
NEXT
DELAY 50
; circles
GCLS
FOR R 4 96 4
  CIRCLE 120 100 R
NEXT
DELAY 50
; a starry sky, in a frame
GCLS
CALL FRAME
REPEAT 400
  PLOT 1+RND(238) 1+RND(198)
NEXT
GTEXT 17 96 STARS
WAIT
; a key: end, back to text
END

SUB FRAME
  BOX 0 0 239 199
  BOX 3 3 236 196
ENDSUB
